## To Do -- Critical Path (Do First)

> These tasks feed everything downstream. The Workday scrape provides training data for H2O, the PoC validates the architecture for the Streamlit app, and Assignment 5 is a course deliverable.

| # | Task | Priority | Depends On | Assignee |
|---|------|----------|------------|----------|
| A1 | **Environment setup: venv + Java JDK** | HIGH | -- | |
| | Create .venv/ in project root. Install all deps (h2o, streamlit, plotly, seaborn, matplotlib, shap, google-generativeai + existing). Java JDK 11+ required for H2O. | | | |
| A2 | **Workday scrape (CQM orchestrated)** | HIGH | A1 | |
| | Scrape ~149 W&M Workday postings via JSON API (POST list + GET detail). Cache raw JSON to raw_workday/. Filter faculty. Rate limit 1-2s. Extract labels (comp grade, job profile, job family) as ground truth. | | | |
| A3 | **Label stripping + censored PDs** | HIGH | A2 | |
| | Strip classification fields (comp grade, job profile, job family, salary, job req ID) from PD text. Keep duties, qualifications, department. Spot-check 10+ censored PDs to verify no label leakage. | | | |
| A4 | **Feature engineering on censored PDs** | HIGH | A3 | |
| | Extract structured signals via regex or LLM: budget mentions, supervision level, domain keywords, education requirements, decision scope. Build tabular DataFrame for H2O AutoML training. | | | |
| A5 | **H2O AutoML training** | HIGH | A1, A4 | |
| | Train on tabular features. Predict occupational family (7 classes). Leaderboard, variable importance, SHAP (global + local), PDP. Stratified CV. Evaluate with macro F1 and top-3 accuracy. | | | |

