## To Do -- Assignment 5: LangChain Proof-of-Concept (PoC)

> Assignment 5 is integrated into GRIFFIN as a formal milestone. The LangChain PoC validates the three-stage architecture before the production Streamlit app is built. Submit on Gradescope.

| # | Task | Priority | Depends On | Assignee |
|---|------|----------|------------|----------|
| B1 | **LangChain multi-agent PoC** | HIGH | A2, A5 | |
| | Wire up three-stage architecture with all 8 required components: (1) LLM init, (2) ML Shortlist Agent + LLM Classifier Agent, (3) multi-turn message handling, (4) streaming output, (5) custom tools (query_dhrm_database, extract_features_from_pd), (6) external API (Tavily/BLS), (7) agent memory (InMemorySaver), (8) HR Assistant Orchestrator. | | | |
| B2 | **skill.md + template files** | MEDIUM | B1 | |
| | Evolve classification prompt v1 into structured skill.md format with typed parameters. Templates for agent tool use. Zip for Gradescope submission. | | | |
| B3 | **Design rationale report (1 page)** | MEDIUM | B1 | |
| | Markdown report: system architecture, which agent does what, design decisions, LangChain as production framework. | | | |

