## Suggested Task Assignments

For a team of 4, here's one way to split the remaining 16 open tasks:

| Team Member | Tasks | Focus Area |
|-------------|-------|------------|
| **Member A** | #1 README, #2 Kanban board, #6 Responsible AI | GitHub + documentation |
| **Member B** | #3 Streamlit app, #12 Pay prompt | Application + prompts |
| **Member C** | #7 Cloud SQL, #8 Visualizations, #11 Folder structure | Big Data technical |
| **Member D** | #4 Poster, #5 Research paper, #9 Slide deck | Presentations |
| **Everyone** | #13 Validate positions | Each person tests 2-3 positions |
| **After validation** | #14 Data dictionary, #15 SOP, #16 Validation report | HR package |

