## Quick Start for New Team Members

1. Clone the repo
2. Open `griffin_dhrm_pipeline.ipynb` -- this is the core notebook
3. Look at `hr_handoff/` -- these are the finished data files
4. Read `Course References/wm-hr-classification-project-prompt-v3.md` -- this is the full project spec
5. Pick a task from the "To Do" section above and tell the team
6. Run `docs/github-issues-setup.sh` in the repo to create GitHub Issues (needs `gh` CLI)
